{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Teruteru Bouze named &quot;Terunyan&quot; loves The Sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As usual, Terunyan is wandering around and collecting elementals as a hobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terunyan to Amanoiwato is a rhythm game in which Terunyan straight ahead and collects elementals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elementals can be efficiently gathered by collecting them in rhythm to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can collect elementals that come to the judgment area near Terunyan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, failure to collect elementals will reduce Terunyan's motivation and increase the density of the fog in the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, if Terunyan's motivation reaches zero, Terunyan will return home and the game will be over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good news for those who want to reduce the fog and enjoy the cute appearance of Terunyan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Ternyan collects elementals, it accumulates energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You can use that energy to activate skills and blow away the fog that occurs when you fail.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2846000?t=1743594001","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743594001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743594001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743594001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3525410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Teruteru Bouze named &quot;Terunyan&quot; loves The Sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As usual, Terunyan is wandering around and collecting elementals as a hobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terunyan to Amanoiwato is a rhythm game in which Terunyan straight ahead and collects elementals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elementals can be efficiently gathered by collecting them in rhythm to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can collect elementals that come to the judgment area near Terunyan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, failure to collect elementals will reduce Terunyan's motivation and increase the density of the fog in the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, if Terunyan's motivation reaches zero, Terunyan will return home and the game will be over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good news for those who want to reduce the fog and enjoy the cute appearance of Terunyan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Ternyan collects elementals, it accumulates energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You can use that energy to activate skills and blow away the fog that occurs when you fail.</p>","developers":["Terunyan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846000/header.jpg?t=1743594001","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":2